Negative: an opening bracket that starts a parenthetical or citation in running text,
" (" or " [" after a word, number or closing punctuation (e.g. "were significantly (",
"presentation (", "[43]"). Brackets after code keywords or symbols ("=", ":", "/") and
unspaced "(" stay near zero.

